This directory contains the files implementing a completion procedure.

***********   The Interpreter

To run the interpreter : elan gpo file.spc

Example:

elan gpo append.spc < SAMPLES/gpo.inp
 
**********    The Compiler

To run the compiler : elanc gpo file.spc

Example:

elanc gpo append.spc ; gmake --file gpo.make ; a.out < SAMPLES/gpo.inp
